{"meta":{"ui":"itinerary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"generate","prompt":"Plan two days in Kyoto as an inline itinerary: a timeline per day with times, places, how to get between them and how long it takes. Each stop expands for details, each day has a checklist of things to book that I can tick off, and a line at the top says how many are left.","text":"Column gap:12 pad:16 w:390\n  Text.title \"Two days in Kyoto\"\n  state booked=0\n  Text.muted \"{booked} of 6 bookings left to make\"\n  state d1book=[{\"item\":\"Kinkaku-ji timed entry\",\"done\":false},{\"item\":\"Kaiseki dinner in Gion\",\"done\":false},{\"item\":\"Arashiyama bamboo grove guide\",\"done\":false}]\n  state d2book=[{\"item\":\"Fushimi Inari early slot\",\"done\":false},{\"item\":\"Tea ceremony in Higashiyama\",\"done\":false},{\"item\":\"Nishiki Market cooking class\",\"done\":false}]\n  Card gap:8\n    Text.heading \"Day 1: Northwest and Gion\"\n    Accordion\n      ListTile \"08:30 Kinkaku-ji\" \"Golden pavilion, about 1 hour\"\n        Column gap:6 pad:8\n          Text.small \"Stop by Kyoto Station, then the city bus 205 to Kinkakuji-michi, about 40 min.\"\n          Text.caption \"Arrive early to beat tour groups. Allow 60 min on site.\"\n      ListTile \"10:45 Arashiyama\" \"Bamboo grove and Tenryu-ji\"\n        Column gap:6 pad:8\n          Text.small \"Train from Kitaoji line transfer, roughly 25 min by JR Sagano line.\"\n          Text.caption \"The grove is quietest before 9:00 but still calm at midday. Plan 90 min.\"\n      ListTile \"13:30 Lunch, Tofuya-Ukai\" \"Tofu kaiseki by the river\"\n        Column gap:6 pad:8\n          Text.small \"Walk 10 min from the grove, along the Katsura river path.\"\n          Text.caption \"Reservations recommended, budget about 60 min.\"\n      ListTile \"16:00 Gion\" \"Old streets at dusk\"\n        Column gap:6 pad:8\n          Text.small \"Train back to Kyoto Station, then bus 206 to Gion, about 45 min total.\"\n          